# The floor is narrow on purpose: the two checkers, the contract content they
# check, the pin that decides WHICH vendored artifact they read, and the
# workflows that decide whether they run at all. A pull request that could
# change what runs cannot clear itself.

# The conformance validator. Its bytes are inside the wallet-v1.0
# byte-identity floor; a change here is a contract-behaviour change.
/scripts/validate-openxwallet.py   @brettheap

# The syntax gate.
/scripts/wallet-yaml-syntax-gate.py   @brettheap

# The pin verifier: the only thing standing between a swapped vendored schema
# and a validator that checks presence rather than identity.
/scripts/verify-contract-pin.py   @brettheap

# The contract content, the manifest, the changelog, and the vendored artifact.
/contracts/   @brettheap

# WHICH openxFactory commit and WHICH digest the vendored artifact must match.
/contract_pin.yaml   @brettheap

# Whether the checks run, in what order, and under which status-check token.
/.github/workflows/   @brettheap
